COMPILATION OF: E48C8

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48C8

   1 a 0000 E48C8:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P2c] THE EXPLICIT STATIC VARYING CELLS: `dcl nm char(14) varying static
   4 a 0006 initial('AB')' -- the attribute spelling of E46F5, EXPR2, FSCAN
   5 a 0006 and LOAN2, which DR compiled (all four corpus witnesses are
   6 a 0006 AUTHENTIC) but which no probe has ever put through a COMPARE.  P8
   7 a 0006 predicts DR accepts, lays the varying cell below the pool [C114],
   8 a 0006 and that a flat static cell keeps the immediate-address 17-byte
   9 a 0006 SCVCM form (its address, like a flat auto's, needs no load). */
  10 c 0006   dcl b bit(1) static initial('0'b);
  11 c 0006   dcl nm char(14) varying static initial('AB');
  12 c 0006   b = (nm = 'EOF');
  13 c 0017   put list(nm);
  14 c 002C   put list('B=', b);
  15 c 004E   stop;
  16 a 0051 end E48C8;

CODE SIZE = 0051
DATA AREA = 0015
FREE SYMS = 389E
END  COMPILATION
